            "notes": "This deck revolves around controlling the game by manipulating resources, disrupting opponents' strategies, and ultimately outvaluing them through card advantage. Aminatou's ability to flicker permanents provides flexibility in reusing powerful effects such as planeswalkers, removal spells, and card draw engines. The deck includes a wide range of versatile cards, including removal spells like Swords to Plowshares and Vindicate, counterspells like Force of Will and Mana Leak, and card advantage engines like Jace, the Mind Sculptor and Snapcaster Mage. With a mix of proactive threats, disruptive spells, and versatile answers, the deck aims to control the game at every stage, gradually grinding out incremental advantages until securing victory."
